{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38283","headline":"春闷偶成十二韵 · 韩偓","name":"春闷偶成十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阡陌悬云壤，阑畦隔艾芝。\n路遥行雨嬾，河阔过桥迟。\n雁足应难达，狐踪浪得疑。\n谢鲲吟未废，张硕梦堪思。\n有意通情处，无言拢鬓时。\n格高归敛笑，歌怨在颦眉。\n醉後金蝉重，欢余玉燕敧。\n素姿凌白柰，圆颊诮红棃。\n粉字题花笔，香牋咏柳诗。\n绣窗携手约，芳草蹋青期。\n别泪开泉脉，春愁罥藕丝。\n相思不相信，幽恨更谁知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}